(text "Power comes from the dev-board headers: +5V (J4 pins 7-9) and +3V3 (J4 pins 10-12); no USB 3\nconnector. +3V3 feeds TVP7002 IOVDD, the oscillator, pull-ups and the bus-control gate. +5V feeds\none TPS563201 buck to 2.5 V (SLVSD90B Table 7-2: R2 = 10k, L = 2.2 uH, 2 x 22 uF out), which is the\npre-regulator for the 1.9 V LDOs (OSSC pattern). EN has an internal pull-down, so it is tied up\nthrough 100k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3cee9549-4987-5347-8e50-c5b4103bc836"))
